@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra dich vu - mong doi 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap - mong doi 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments
Accept: application/json

### 3. Nop bai hop le - mong doi 201 Created
# @name validSubmission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200016",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/trungdtt123-cmd/CNTTK23E"
}

### 4. Lay luot nop vua tao - mong doi 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{validSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Nop bai thieu du lieu - mong doi 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Nop vao bai tap ID 99 - mong doi 404 Not Found
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200016",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/trungdtt123-cmd/CNTTK23E"
}

### 7. Lay luot nop voi GUID rong - mong doi 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 8. Bat tay SignalR dung duong dan - mong doi 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Bat tay SignalR sai duong dan - mong doi 404 Not Found
POST {{baseUrl}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Nop vao bai tap ID 999 - mong doi 404 Not Found
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200016",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/trungdtt123-cmd/CNTTK23E"
}
